n\r\netcd-0                                                         Running     maroonedpods-group-clusters-tenant-clean\r\nfeaturegate-generator-87hpb                                    Succeeded   maroonedpods-group-clusters-tenant-clean\r\nhosted-cluster-config-operator-7649fb87d8-jrv7c                Running     maroonedpods-group-clusters-tenant-clean\r\n"]
